{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"93","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord reigns, clothed in majesty, the Lord clothes Himself in strength, He girds Himself. Surely the world stands firm without shaking. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thy throne is established from of old, since eternity art Thou. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The streams, O Lord, the streams have raised their voice, the streams shall raise their roar. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Mightier than many waters are the breakers of the sea but still mightier on high is the Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thy testimonies are indeed sure, holiness becomes Thine House, O Lord, for an infinity of days. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
